acbcf603f33fdfe3c34b704a8b019c4fd32a8376 (2026-04-13) and imported into this
repository through the GeoForge snapshot Nicander93/3dtiles
engines/3dtiles-converter at commit bdb8b7fd31c1eaa7ef65ad9f3419c6ab8c56c149
(see docs/UPSTREAM.md). The upstream project does not ship a NOTICE file, and
its source files carry no per-file copyright headers.

