Summary of the functional changes: Windows x64 release packaging; OSGB
block-level parallel conversion with streaming, resume and a block manifest;
serialized OGR coordinate transformations and OSG database reads for
multi-threaded OSGB conversion; model import configuration (--model-config,
units, axes, georeference, missing-texture policy and texture roots); FBX
texture path recovery, warnings for ignored animation and skinning, and native
warnings and errors repeated on stderr; vendored tinygltf headers; and
documentation for these changes.

Third-party components
----------------------
Binary releases of geoforge-converter bundle third-party libraries. Their
names, versions, licenses, source locations and license texts are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt and in the licenses/ directory of each release
archive. Information about obtaining the source code of the LGPL- and
MPL-licensed libraries is in LGPL-SOURCE-OFFER.txt in the same archive.
